id: pm-csv-packed-custom-fields
title: Prove packed CSV custom fields survive export and re-import
description: "Packed acceptance currently exports fixtures without custom fields, so all-fields success cannot prove custom schema discovery or values. Follow-up to the non-blocking review of PR #196."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-26T08:13:37.474Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-27T09:09:19.708Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-27T09:09:18.352Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-26T15:02:23.000Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: "Seed string, number, boolean, date, list and empty custom fields through the installed host SDK in a non-git tracker; assert packed exports column by column; re-import into a fresh tracker and compare SDK state; regression fails after behavioral revert; targeted tests, typecheck and lint pass; CI npm and Bun release gates pass."
repro_steps: Run NPM_CONFIG_USERCONFIG=/dev/null NPM_CONFIG_PREFER_OFFLINE=true NPM_CONFIG_FETCH_TIMEOUT=30000 NPM_CONFIG_FETCH_RETRIES=1 node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/packed-custom-fields.test.ts against the packed package and compare exported values with installed SDK state.
resolution: "Merged PR #202 at 6350dc85597f9019a9148b1ac44221467546ed62; inspected test/packed-custom-fields.test.ts and ran NPM_CONFIG_USERCONFIG=/dev/null NPM_CONFIG_PREFER_OFFLINE=true NPM_CONFIG_FETCH_TIMEOUT=30000 NPM_CONFIG_FETCH_RETRIES=1 node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/packed-custom-fields.test.ts on main. Installed npm-current, Bun-current and minimum hosts export six custom columns and round-trip values through the SDK on non-git trackers; invalid proof fixtures refuse. CLI custom-column import remains a separate open issue."
expected_result: "Seed string, number, boolean, date, list and empty custom fields through the installed host SDK in a non-git tracker; assert packed exports column by column; re-import into a fresh tracker and compare SDK state; regression fails after behavioral revert; targeted tests, typecheck and lint pass; CI npm and Bun release gates pass."
actual_result: "Installed npm-current, Bun-current and minimum hosts export six custom columns and round-trip values through the SDK on non-git trackers; invalid proof fixtures refuse. CLI custom-column import remains a separate open issue."
comments[11]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-26T08:17:29.187Z",codex-agent,"Searched active and historical tracker items; this acceptance gap is distinct from the merged SDK adoption task. Plan: seed six custom columns through each installed SDK in non-git trackers, check discovery and explicit selection cell by cell, add behavioral regression/revert proof, and verify re-import state through the SDK. Runtime schemas encode dates as ISO string values. The legacy importer currently ignores custom columns; requested scope clarification while implementing export proof."
  "2026-10-26T08:23:48.700Z",codex-agent,"Acceptance scope remains export proof plus SDK import-adapter roundtrip: packed CSV decoding feeds a fresh tracker, then source and destination custom metadata are compared through SDK reads. Legacy CLI import custom-column support is a distinct feature tracked by pm-csv-import-custom-columns. Linked test isolation clears inherited PM_PATH so each scenario owns its non-git tracker."
  "2026-10-26T08:26:03.644Z",codex-agent,"Minimum-host diagnosis: schemaAddField(name, {type}) silently registers a string in pm 2026.8.20 because its dispatcher reads fieldType. The fixture supplies both typed and legacy option names and asserts the SDK registry types before persisting data with commitImportedItem. This avoids normalizing a broken seed into expected values; every SDK read must match the original typed fixture. No host dependency bump or upstream modification."
  "2026-10-26T08:29:18.523Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof: restored only scripts/accept-packed.ts from origin/main, retaining the new fixture module and regression test. node --test test/packed-custom-fields.test.ts fails 1/2 with npm-current: custom_columns_exported is undefined rather than 6; the old packed script itself succeeds, proving its false-positive gap. Restored the fixed script in a finally block; no product source or history records changed. The fixed version previously passed 2/2 across all three scenarios; running final linked checks next."
  "2026-10-26T08:30:59.287Z",codex-agent,"Final local verification passes after restoring the fix: tracker-linked node --test test/packed-custom-fields.test.ts is 2/2, node --test test/sdk-adoption.test.ts is 4/4; no failures or skips. npm run typecheck, npm run build:test, npm run lint, npm run duplicates and npm run docstring pass (115 documented declarations; zero clones). Strict health passes with an empty global pm context; ordinary local health reports the already tracked pm-csv-sdyz global extension skew. Full unchanged npm and Bun release gates will run in CI before final handoff."
  "2026-10-26T08:35:09.894Z",codex-agent,"Opened ready-for-review PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-csv/pull/202 at d9f33ec. Full CI matrix https://github.com/unbraind/pm-csv/actions/runs/40292925244 is queued for GitHub runners; waiting for both Node versions and both npm/Bun release gates. No merge requested or performed."
  "2026-10-26T08:51:56.466Z",codex-agent,"Full source-head CI passed at d9f33ec7bf19fb5b0f9da6ab603c86ee4ba38881: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-csv/actions/runs/40292925244. Node 22 and 26 each passed npm run release:check and bun run release:check, each with 341 tests and all eight configured coverage sources meeting unchanged thresholds. Verified all 12 direct packed receipts: six custom columns and SDK roundtrip true in npm-current, bun-current and npm-minimum for every gate. Strict tracker health and Bun graph installs also pass. CodeQL and available static checks pass; skipped/neutral automated reviewers are not review approval. Releasing the claim for owner verification; the item stays in progress and the import follow-up stays open. The final tracker-only commit will receive a fresh matrix linked from https://github.com/unbraind/pm-csv/pull/202/checks."
  "2026-10-27T09:00:31.845Z",codex-agent,"Closure audit: verify every acceptance criterion on current main against merged PR #202 (6350dc85597f9019a9148b1ac44221467546ed62), inspect test/packed-custom-fields.test.ts, and run the focused linked check before closing. Completion will be the merge timestamp 2026-10-26T15:02:23Z."
  "2026-10-27T09:07:00.213Z",codex-agent,"Closure audit: the custom-export oracle test passed, but the installed-matrix child exceeded its unchanged 290-second deadline without a complete receipt. No closure is justified by that attempt. Retry with cached-package preference and bounded registry fetches; keep all assertions, timeouts and thresholds unchanged."
  "2026-10-27T09:07:10.677Z",codex-agent,"Closure audit: verify every acceptance criterion on current main against merged PR #202 (6350dc85597f9019a9148b1ac44221467546ed62), inspect test/packed-custom-fields.test.ts, and run the focused linked check before closing. Completion will be the merge timestamp 2026-10-26T15:02:23Z."
  "2026-10-27T09:09:17.243Z",codex-agent,"Merged PR #202 at 6350dc85597f9019a9148b1ac44221467546ed62; inspected test/packed-custom-fields.test.ts and ran NPM_CONFIG_USERCONFIG=/dev/null NPM_CONFIG_PREFER_OFFLINE=true NPM_CONFIG_FETCH_TIMEOUT=30000 NPM_CONFIG_FETCH_RETRIES=1 node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/packed-custom-fields.test.ts on main. Installed npm-current, Bun-current and minimum hosts export six custom columns and round-trip values through the SDK on non-git trackers; invalid proof fixtures refuse. CLI custom-column import remains a separate open issue. Full unchanged npm and Bun release gates run in CI for this tracker-only closure PR; prior behavioral revert evidence remains in the merged implementation history."
